{
  "name": "CAG Claim Verification",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CAG Claim Verification\n\nVerify a list of claims against ONE warm document. Each claim is checked with `temperature: 0` and a `json_schema`, so every verdict comes back as strict JSON — `supported`, `absent`, or `contradicted`, with the exact passage. The document is read once (already cached); each claim only costs its own tokens.\n\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/cag/verify \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n        \"document_id\": 7,\n        \"claims\": [\n          \"The peak current limit is 12 A.\",\n          \"Thermal shutdown triggers at 150 C.\",\n          \"The warranty covers water damage.\"\n        ]\n      }'\n```\n\n`document_id` is optional — omit it to verify against the most recently cached document.\nThe response is an array of `{claim, verdict, quote, cache_source, error}`.\nOne failing claim is captured (error branch) and does not abort the batch.\n\nThis is the productized critique loop: a drafting agent (Claude Code, or anything) posts its claims here, reads the verdicts, and refines before shipping.\n\nNo credentials needed — cag-api does all the work.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "cag/verify",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Verify Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 0],
      "webhookId": "7c2dae3f-5b4a-4c9d-ae1f-2a3b4c5d6e7f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "body.claims",
        "include": "allOtherFields",
        "options": {
          "destinationFieldName": "claim"
        }
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Split Claims",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://cag-api:8000/query",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ question: 'Verify this claim strictly against the document: \"' + $json.claim + '\". Respond with your verdict and the exact supporting or contradicting passage.', temperature: 0, document_id: $json.body.document_id, json_schema: { type: 'object', properties: { claim: { type: 'string' }, verdict: { enum: ['supported', 'absent', 'contradicted'] }, quote: { type: 'string' } }, required: ['claim', 'verdict', 'quote'] } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3600000
        }
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Verify Against CAG API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "verify-ok-1",
              "name": "claim",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Claims').item.json.claim }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-ok-2",
              "name": "verdict",
              "value": "={{ (() => { try { return JSON.parse($json.answer).verdict } catch (e) { return null } })() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-ok-3",
              "name": "quote",
              "value": "={{ (() => { try { return JSON.parse($json.answer).quote } catch (e) { return null } })() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-ok-4",
              "name": "cache_source",
              "value": "={{ $json.timings?.cache_source }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-ok-5",
              "name": "error",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Collect Verdict",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [960, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "verify-err-1",
              "name": "claim",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Claims').item.json.claim }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-err-2",
              "name": "verdict",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-err-3",
              "name": "quote",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-err-4",
              "name": "cache_source",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "verify-err-5",
              "name": "error",
              "value": "={{ $json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'CAG API request failed' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Mark Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [960, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateIndividualFields",
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "claim"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "verdict"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "quote"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "cache_source"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "error"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Aggregate Verdicts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5f84a51-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Respond With Verdicts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1480, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
